category: Science
build-depends: cygport cereal ensmallen libarmadillo-devel txt2man
sdesc: "Fast, header-only C++ machine learning library"
ldesc: "mlpack is an intuitive, fast, and flexible header-only C++ machine learning
library with bindings to other languages. It is meant to be a machine learning
analog to LAPACK, and aims to implement a wide array of machine learning
methods and functions as a 'swiss army knife' for machine learning
researchers."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/mlpack/mlpack
license: BSD-3-Clause
